    {
      "text": "Have you ever watched a live show?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.78
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I watched one when I was a freshman — my first time at a live show. It was in a huge place — like a stadium, I guess, not a museum, just a really, really enormous venue. When I sat there, I thought, wow, this feels so unreal. I couldn't believe I was sitting there watching my favorite singer right in front of me — well, there was still a distance, but I could actually see them. The vibe, the people around you, the performance — just amazing. Totally unreal.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 2.17,
      "end": 28.53
    }
